JAYEMATH WATER PROJECT V185 - BUILD PATCH

Purpose:
Fix the Android Gradle module and GitHub Actions build configuration without replacing the existing web app features.

Files in this patch:
1. app/build.gradle
   - Applies the Android application plugin correctly.
   - Adds namespace/applicationId/SDK/version configuration.
   - Uses Java 17.
   - Preserves the existing web-assets preparation task.

2. .github/workflows/build-apk.yml
   - Builds the Android module explicitly with :app:assembleDebug.
