- Replace .github/workflows/build-apk.yml with this patch's workflow file.
- Keep the existing index.html, config.js, sw.js, manifest.webmanifest and cover-768.png in the repository root.
- Keep the existing app/src/main/java and app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml.

Important:
This patch does not contain the 1.2 MB web app index.html or image assets, so existing app functionality is not overwritten.
